<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss version="2.0"><channel><title>Miracle</title><description>Connecting bits into meaning, and moments into miracles.</description><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/</link><item><title>图像检测：Faster R-CNN</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/notes/%E5%9B%BE%E5%83%8F%E6%A3%80%E6%B5%8Bfaster-r-cnn/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/notes/%E5%9B%BE%E5%83%8F%E6%A3%80%E6%B5%8Bfaster-r-cnn/</guid><description>从 Region Proposal Network（RPN）到 ROI Head，理解 Faster R-CNN 的核心创新、完整链路、经典思想与后续发展。</description><pubDate>Mon, 24 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>贝叶斯更新：从先验到后验</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/notes/bayesian-updating/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/notes/bayesian-updating/</guid><description>用几组可计算的例子整理贝叶斯公式、赔率形式与 Beta-Bernoulli 共轭更新。</description><pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>页面底部也是阅读的一部分</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/thoughts#thought-test-latest/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/thoughts#thought-test-latest/</guid><description>当列表足够长，后出现的内容才真正检验滑动浮现是否自然，也能看出错峰时间有没有拖得太久。</description><pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>城市夜行</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/essays/walking-at-night/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/essays/walking-at-night/</guid><description>夜晚把城市从功能中暂时释放出来，也让熟悉的街道显出另一种尺度。</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>当前测试集中较新的笔记</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/notes/test-latest/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/notes/test-latest/</guid><description>用来确认正序排列时最新内容位于列表末尾，切换倒序后则出现在开头。</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>把测试内容也当成真实内容来排版</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/essays/test-latest/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/essays/test-latest/</guid><description>足够多、足够不整齐的文字才能暴露列表设计在真实使用中可能遇到的问题。</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>同一天发布的第一篇测试文章</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/articles/test-same-day-first/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/articles/test-same-day-first/</guid><description>用来观察两篇发布日期完全相同时，列表顺序和编号是否稳定。</description><pubDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>同一天发布的第二篇测试文章，标题稍微长一些</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/articles/test-same-day-second/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/articles/test-same-day-second/</guid><description>日期相同但标题和摘要长度不同，用来观察相邻卡片的层次与悬浮效果。</description><pubDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>与其他内容同日发布</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/notes/test-same-day/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/notes/test-same-day/</guid><description>同一天可以同时出现文章、笔记、手记与感悟，归档和时光页都需要正确显示。</description><pubDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>一则感悟</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/thoughts#thought-test-same-day/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/thoughts#thought-test-same-day/</guid><description>同一天的记录不一定属于同一种内容，但它们都应该在时间线上找到准确的位置。</description><pubDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>一则感悟</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/thoughts#thought-tools-should-disappear/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/thoughts#thought-tools-should-disappear/</guid><description>好工具不是一直提醒你它多强大，而是在需要时出现，完成工作后退回背景。博客的架构也应该如此，写作时只看见内容。</description><pubDate>Mon, 17 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>为什么这个博客选择静态优先</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/articles/static-first-blog/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/articles/static-first-blog/</guid><description>从阅读性能、内容所有权和维护成本出发，解释 Miracle 初版的技术选择。</description><pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Astro 内容集合</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/notes/astro-content-collections/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/notes/astro-content-collections/</guid><description>Miracle 如何统一读取并校验四类 Markdown 内容。</description><pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>学会一个概念，往往发生在建立连接之后</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/thoughts#thought-learning-by-connection/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/thoughts#thought-learning-by-connection/</guid><description>记住定义只是拥有一个碎片。能说出它依赖什么、解释什么、与什么冲突，才开始形成理解。</description><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>从 Markdown 到可交互内容</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/articles/markdown-to-interactive/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/articles/markdown-to-interactive/</guid><description>Markdown 负责叙述，MDX 与客户端小组件负责局部交互，两者不必互相取代。</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>用 CSS 变量维护设计令牌</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/notes/css-design-tokens/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/notes/css-design-tokens/</guid><description>色彩、字体、宽度与圆角为什么集中在一个文件里。</description><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>一则感悟</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/thoughts#thought-version-one/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/thoughts#thought-version-one/</guid><description>第一版最重要的不是提前实现所有可能，而是让下一次修改有清楚的落点。</description><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>留一点闲暇给自己</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/essays/make-room-for-leisure/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/essays/make-room-for-leisure/</guid><description>闲暇不是把日程表清空，而是暂时不要求每一分钟都证明它的用途。</description><pubDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>在知识图谱之前，先设计稳定的内容模型</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/articles/content-model-before-graph/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/articles/content-model-before-graph/</guid><description>图谱可以晚点做，但内容 ID、关系类型和路由边界最好从第一天就想清楚。</description><pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>稳定内容 ID</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/notes/stable-content-id/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/notes/stable-content-id/</guid><description>为未来双向链接和知识关系保留不随 URL 改变的引用。</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>一则感悟</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/thoughts#thought-slow-record/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/thoughts#thought-slow-record/</guid><description>记录不是为了证明每天都有产出。它只是给那些容易消失的东西留一个回来的入口。</description><pubDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>括号、斜线、版本号与代码名：布局边界检查</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/articles/test-punctuation/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/articles/test-punctuation/</guid><description>测试 v2.7.13、Node.js、C++、Rust/WASM、括号（全角与半角）以及连续数字 202608220018 的显示效果。</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Nov 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Keep the rough edges</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/thoughts#thought-test-mixed-language/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/thoughts#thought-test-mixed-language/</guid><description>写作不必在第一次保存时 perfect。先留下 rough edges，之后才知道真正需要修改的是什么。</description><pubDate>Wed, 22 Oct 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>A quiet Sunday 与没有完成的清单</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/essays/test-mixed-language/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/essays/test-mixed-language/</guid><description>中文、English、数字 17 和 Markdown 术语同时出现，观察字体切换与换行是否自然。</description><pubDate>Sun, 17 Aug 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>侧边分类文字长度检查</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/notes/test-category-programming/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/notes/test-category-programming/</guid><description>分类名称写在强调色书脊上，用来观察较长中文分类的纵向排列。</description><pubDate>Sat, 19 Jul 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>一则感悟</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/thoughts#thought-test-long-body/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/thoughts#thought-test-long-body/</guid><description>有些感悟并不只是一句话。它可能先记录一个观察，再补充当时的环境，接着说明为什么这件小事值得被留下。正文增长时，气泡应当顺着内容自然变高，行宽保持适合阅读，下一条内容也要有足够清楚的间隔。</description><pubDate>Mon, 05 May 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>0、1、10、100 与 1000000</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/notes/test-numbers/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/notes/test-numbers/</guid><description>检查等宽数字、中文顿号、逗号和不同位数混排时的基线。</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Mar 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>下雨天留在室内</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/essays/test-daily-long-summary/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/essays/test-daily-long-summary/</guid><description>这是一段明显更长的手记摘要。窗外的雨声持续变化，房间里的光从明亮变得柔和，原本排好的计划也慢慢失去紧迫感。它用于确认列表面对长段文字时可以自然延展，并且不会把日期、分类、编号或阅读全文入口挤到不合适的位置。</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Feb 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>一个长到需要在较窄屏幕上自然换行但不应该挤压日期的感悟标题</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/thoughts#thought-test-long-title/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/thoughts#thought-test-long-title/</guid><description>长标题测试的是信息层级，而不是装饰效果。</description><pubDate>Sat, 28 Dec 2024 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>当一件事情已经结束很久我们为什么仍然会在某个普通下午重新想起它</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/essays/test-reflection-long-title/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/essays/test-reflection-long-title/</guid><description>长标题与较长摘要同时出现，用来检查特色纸页、年份分组、归档行和搜索结果在不同宽度下的文字换行。</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Oct 2024 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>URL 与连续字符</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/notes/test-long-url/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/notes/test-long-url/</guid><description>https://example.com/a/really/long/document/path/that/keeps/going/without/a/comfortable/visual/pause</description><pubDate>Sat, 24 Aug 2024 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>连续字符与超长链接边界</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/articles/test-long-token/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/articles/test-long-token/</guid><description>检查 ContentAddressableStorageWithoutAnyNaturalBreakPointInItsIdentifier 和 https://example.com/research/archive/a-very-long-path-without-a-convenient-break-point 在窄屏中的表现。</description><pubDate>Tue, 11 Jun 2024 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>那些只见过一次的人</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/essays/test-people/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/essays/test-people/</guid><description>一次短暂交谈也可能留下很久的影响，尤其是在彼此都不知道以后不会再见的时候。</description><pubDate>Tue, 14 May 2024 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Notes on resilient content layouts</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/notes/test-english/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/notes/test-english/</guid><description>English words have different rhythm and width, especially when mixed with CSS properties and component names.</description><pubDate>Tue, 09 Apr 2024 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>有标题的感悟</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/thoughts#thought-test-with-title/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/thoughts#thought-test-with-title/</guid><description>标题存在时，它应当位于日期和正文气泡之间，仍然保持清楚的阅读顺序。</description><pubDate>Sat, 16 Mar 2024 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>从 Content Collection 到静态路由的 mixed-language 测试</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/articles/test-mixed-language/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/articles/test-mixed-language/</guid><description>同时包含 Astro、TypeScript、CSS Grid、中文标点与 2026 年日期，检查不同字宽组合下的换行节奏。</description><pubDate>Thu, 29 Feb 2024 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>当一本笔记的标题需要连续换行时书封上的日期与摘要仍然应该留在明确的位置</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/notes/test-long-title/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/notes/test-long-title/</guid><description>长标题与普通长度摘要同时出现。</description><pubDate>Wed, 17 Jan 2024 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>在陌生城市走错一条路</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/essays/test-travel/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/essays/test-travel/</guid><description>离开预先规划的路线以后，城市不再只是几个景点之间的连线，街角、坡度和声音开始组成真正的方向感。</description><pubDate>Tue, 19 Dec 2023 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>一则感悟</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/thoughts#thought-test-no-title/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/thoughts#thought-test-no-title/</guid><description>没有标题的感悟只显示日期和正文，内容长度接近普通的一句话，用来确认气泡顶部不会留下多余空白。</description><pubDate>Tue, 07 Nov 2023 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>摘要完整展开测试</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/notes/test-long-description/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/notes/test-long-description/</guid><description>这段笔记摘要故意超过常见的两行和三行长度。它会持续补充背景、方法、限制与结论，用来确认书册不会截断文字，也不会把摘要压到标题上方。内容变长以后整张书册应自然向下延伸，同一排的另一张书册可以保持视觉上的行高对齐。</description><pubDate>Fri, 06 Oct 2023 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>一段明显更长的摘要</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/articles/test-long-summary/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/articles/test-long-summary/</guid><description>这是一段刻意写得很长的文章摘要，用来检查真实写作中连续解释背景、交代问题、补充限制条件并说明最终结论时，卡片能否自然增高，文字是否会和日期、标题或交互区域发生碰撞，同时也用来观察多张高度不同的文章卡片连续排列时页面是否依然清楚。</description><pubDate>Wed, 27 Sep 2023 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>读完以后先不急着总结</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/essays/test-reading/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/essays/test-reading/</guid><description>有些阅读需要先在脑中停留一段时间，观点之间的联系不会在合上书的那一刻立刻变得清楚。</description><pubDate>Fri, 30 Jun 2023 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>极短摘要</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/notes/test-tiny-description/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/notes/test-tiny-description/</guid><description>短。</description><pubDate>Sun, 21 May 2023 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>当标题长到需要换成两行甚至三行时文章卡片内部应该怎样保持清楚的阅读层次</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/articles/test-long-title/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/articles/test-long-title/</guid><description>这篇内容用于观察长标题换行后，编号、分类、日期、摘要和右侧提示之间是否仍然保持稳定。</description><pubDate>Tue, 18 Apr 2023 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>一则感悟</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/thoughts#thought-test-one-word/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/thoughts#thought-test-one-word/</guid><description>停。</description><pubDate>Sun, 12 Mar 2023 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>没有显式摘要的笔记</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/notes/test-no-description/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/notes/test-no-description/</guid><description>没有填写 description 时，系统应从正文提取一段可读的摘要，并且仍然保留至少两行的摘要空间。</description><pubDate>Wed, 08 Feb 2023 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>短</title><link>https://nihility-cool.github.io/articles/test-short-title/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nihility-cool.github.io/articles/test-short-title/</guid><description>只有一个字的标题，用来观察最短内容在文章列表中的重心。</description><pubDate>Tue, 03 Jan 2023 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item></channel></rss>